ge obscures risk.","opening_line":"The beacon check is not a ritual to prove you belong. It is how we discover a problem while we still have choices.","circle_slugs":["talia-valdez","anika-vogel","marisol-vega","cassidy-reed","tomas-ibarra","graham-pike","imani-brooks","rowan-lee"],"romance_style":"Understated adult warmth, intellectual rapport, and intimacy earned through shared attention and calm honesty.","desire":"To become a cooperative partner and build an education program that changes judgment rather than merely certifying attendance.","complication":"Marketing wants concise reassurance; real education often leaves people more aware of uncertainty.","private_truth":"He has begun photographing ordinary NorthVale life and worries that wanting a permanent home contradicts the mobility he once treated as freedom.","seasonal_status":"third_year_permanent_intent","boundaries":["Guide expertise never becomes pressure to take risk.","Do not turn cultural background into exotic mystique."],"home_style":"A tidy apartment above High Country Guides with maps, chessboard, photographs, a serious kitchen, touring equipment, and a notebook of places that have started to feel like home.","schedule_flavor":{"weekday_evening":"Cooking, playing chess, or comparing field notes with Imani","friday_activity":"Finishing education sessions before a Last Light meal with the basin circle","saturday_activity":"Leading a conservative tour, teaching a long workshop, and skiing an easy Nordic loop after","sunday_activity":"Cleaning gear, printing photographs, and calling family without presenting NorthVale as a temporary adventure","community_day":1,"community_slug":"last-light-roadhouse","community_activity":"Opening the Monday basin table with one field observation and refusing to let the group skip directly to conclusions"},"template_id":"24000000-0000-4000-8011-000000000044","version_id":"25000000-0000-4000-8011-000000000044","relationship_goal":"either","can_be_selected":true,"can_be